---
import ContactCta from '../components/ContactCta.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import ProcessRail from '../components/ProcessRail.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn about the working approach behind Clever Cat Company."
>
  <PageHero
    title="About"
    intro="A broad creative and technical company built around useful outcomes, clear thinking, and a willingness to make the work tangible."
  />

  <section class="about-story">
    <div class="shell about-story__grid">
      <div class="about-story__lead">
        <p>
          Some ideas need a website. Some need a product concept, a visual system, a prototype, or a better way to
          explain what is already there. Clever Cat Company exists to work across those boundaries when that is the
          most practical route forward.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-story__body">
        <p>
          The service catalog is intentionally still taking shape. Rather than promise a fixed list of outcomes,
          this first site centers the areas where digital craft, visual design, engineering thinking, and creative
          production can reinforce one another.
        </p>
        <p>
          The goal is simple: understand what matters, shape a clear direction, make the right thing, and improve
          the details that make it useful.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ProcessRail />
  <ContactCta />
</BaseLayout>
